        <mxCell id="note" value="The one architectural rule enforced from day one:&#10;no pipeline calls a model directly &#8212; every call goes&#10;through the LLM Gateway. The fallback router&#10;(local Ollama, paid escalation) is designed but not&#10;built in v1; it attaches here without touching&#10;any pipeline." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#22536F;fillColor=#EEF6FB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22536F;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
